{"t":9.1,"issued":9.1,"cmd":"note","args":{"text":"I see a red popcorn machine in the middle inside a faint circle, a coin counter at 0 on top, back arrow, sound and restart buttons. A finger icon points at the machine so I think I should tap it to pop popcorn and earn coins. Bottom card shows a grey bucket/bag, price 24 coins and an up arrow - probably an upgrade I can buy once I have 24 coins. I'll tap the machine first."}}
